{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3385, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3200, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3390, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f1cff8f3f2d5f293f8e7f94bf349f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "좋은 승부를 해 봐요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いい勝負にしましょうね！", "pointer_offset": 3204, "unit": "dialogue:c132c161325a70ae", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 4104, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff8dff64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//제 패가//보너스 패예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//あたしのパイが//ボーナスパイなんですよ。", "pointer_offset": 3208, "unit": "dialogue:fad8df6e67049bee", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3472, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f299f149f0b8f0cf81442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1fbc1f1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이것입니다．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこちらです。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてくださいね。", "pointer_offset": 3212, "unit": "dialogue:b422d39d7a59a6f1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3543, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0dff1442f2ff5f3f0c7f8e7f362f0c8f0f1f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "제가//딜러를 맡을게요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたしが//親をやりますね。", "pointer_offset": 3216, "unit": "dialogue:33048f155072db86", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 4145, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0f32f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f944f5f3f0c7f26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "다음은//오오가미 씨가 딜러예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次、//大神さんが親ですよ。", "pointer_offset": 3220, "unit": "dialogue:b7d7cc4668c4b4f7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3597, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "fbf4f3d6f8aff1e2f0bcf2a22f2ff14ff0cff0aef984f154f0c8f0f1f0ef81608144", "baseline_text": "또 찾아 주시길//기다리고 있을게요～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "またのご来店を、//お待ちしてまーす。", "pointer_offset": 3224, "unit": "dialogue:85e14fdf30114ad8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3634, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f14ef17bf9d4f2b8f0a5f9c7f25df157f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "조금만 더하면 됐는데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あとちょっとだったのに……", "pointer_offset": 3228, "unit": "dialogue:b2843dce38300d15", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 4077, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0b9f957f0a4f8a4f287f8c8f2aff0b8f261f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "다음에는 지지 않을 테니까요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は負けませんからね。", "pointer_offset": 3232, "unit": "dialogue:0f1133b2aab26778", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3684, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f248f0b9f15781432f2ff2d5f293f8e7f19cf0f4fb84f14bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "다음번에는，//승부를 내도록 해요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次こそは、//勝負をつけましょうね！", "pointer_offset": 3236, "unit": "dialogue:db21b3883be7cb76", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3719, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f8f3f0bbf0aef8dbf247f9d7f2d5f293f26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "다음은 글리신 씨와 승부예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は、グリシーヌさんと勝負ですよ。", "pointer_offset": 3240, "unit": "dialogue:8c1f46097800e140", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3754, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3244, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT20TSUB.SBN", "offset": 3777, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3248, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
